      "rationale": "The config claimed coverage CI did not actually provide. Correcting CLAUDE.md, adding a 'What runs in CI' section to testing.md, and filing a tracking issue makes the gap explicit instead of implied \u2014 a green CI badge should not imply specs that never ran.",
